  "question": {
    "text": "The length of the minor axis of the ellipse <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "w6pxY",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "EWas0",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JsOAu",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gn3T3",
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> units",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is an ellipse, whose focus is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> directix <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and eccentricity is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Length of <math><mo>⊥</mo></math> from focus to directrix is <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math><br />So, length of major axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>20</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>and length of minor axis,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>",
